			<div class="content" id="post-content-2530690">
									

<p>I enjoyed it, and I want to hit that big juicy + button, but I just can't&#8230;.yet. The one thing that lets me down is that the appearance of the boxes is purely random (as far as anyone can tell). Yes, that leads to &quot;It could happen anywhere, even to you!&quot; but I actually think it would be more interesting if the Foundation started to pick up on some kind of pattern, maybe something only super subtle, but enough to increase the layer of &quot;uh oh&quot;. If it's purely random, then that's all there is to the story. If there is a method, then that's freakier in many ways. Just my opinion, and overall it was a good read.</p>

